name=HARMONIE - ModernFirearmsSystem Fix
id=HARMONIE_ModernFirearmsSystemFix
description=Three fixes for "ModernFirearmsSystem" (Workshop ID 3633421539). (1) Adds a sandbox option (HARMONIE: ModernFirearmsSystem Fix -> Gun/ammo drop rate multiplier) since the mod ships its ~230 guns and ammo items at hardcoded loot weights with no rate control of its own -- only per-gun on/off toggles. Scales all of them together (0-5x, default 1.0 = unchanged) without touching vanilla loot or the mod's weapon attachments/parts. (2) A defensive guard against a possible ammo-not-depleting race in the mod's own magazine-refresh system (ChangeMagazineType.lua), which can swap the held weapon for a fresh item mid-action; the guard defers that resync while the player has a timed action queued. (3) Supplies the missing English text for the mod's own in-game Mod Options page (Options -> Mods -> Modern Firearms System) -- the mod only ever shipped Chinese translations for those strings, so English (and every other non-Chinese language) showed raw untranslated keys like "UI_options_AWCWF_title" instead of real text. Requires ModernFirearmsSystem and must load after it.
require=ModernFirearmsSystem
author=HARMONIE
modversion=1.0
versionMin=42.0.0
